# Raw model responses from contract-stability.ts. The scored summary in
# evidence/ IS versioned; these are the bulk it was scored from.
.local-coder/contract-spill/

# PER-MACHINE, and it has to be: `detectChecks` picks `npx.cmd`/`npm.cmd` on
# win32 and `npx`/`npm` everywhere else (src/checks/config.ts:183, :242), so a
# versioned file carrying either spelling breaks the gate on the other platform
# — and `loadChecks` REPLACES autodetection rather than merging with it
# (:295-297), so the breakage is total, not partial. A machine that needs its
# own checks writes them here and they stay here.
.local-coder/checks.json

# mac-check.sh probe, removed on exit; listed so an interrupted run cannot dirty the tree
.mac-check-status.*.mts
.b12/
